{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83688947fe14b95714242286156623b67ae0831.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 7b = 1977$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a17fc08c1a5cae44b7cb7f77a34d1ae4ee1853d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + b = 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c181860b98e9925f43c240ec97ba675372e9aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\, 488\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\, 498$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83688947fe14b95714242286156623b67ae0831.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 7b = 1977$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a17fc08c1a5cae44b7cb7f77a34d1ae4ee1853d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + b = 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/8/c78e4f5f96737dd6ef23dddc61dad286c321722d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2007-5a$\" width=\"109\" height=\"12\" />, and substituting, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bbaa7f8a82e0b065b75c9a31ff3f3548be392f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+14049-35a=1977\\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"219\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/26204e6713f8df1a397e8c58b49c3621f5023c91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-32a=-12072\\Rightarrow a=377.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"237\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/6709252848a931c26ff44de5bfbe8db63e7f43a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2007-1886.25\\Rightarrow b=120.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"260\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/f/2ff6cbf3ff9e66b3d6166e26da7b4358fac73c80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=377.25+120.75=498$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"238\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85439ec29c614c905b367c032e86f8ec7d34526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solution\">Alternate Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/a/6fafbbb361e11620d8b07866079a3234296d02cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+7b=1977$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953440ef604d5e85a27682613799d914c1d95cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a+b=2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" />. Notice the symmetry we have if we add the two equations together: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3ba4c885e6aa33837e673aeab02a06a6f880c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a+8b=3984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />. Dividing by 8, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eb6d5e86e1761d5695ab85915b4b5b77cf82b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=498$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d6070ef440d6b07d7bee9ee024465bf5ef34a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a hre